 ns Reply text;out
⍝ Send an error message to one connection only (supplied: Run loads it into #.Ex4)
⍝ ns   - the connection's namespace (in Receive, that's msg.##)
⍝ text - the message; the client gets {"type":"error","text":"..."}
 out←⎕NS''
 out.(type text)←'error'text
 ns.conx ns.Server.WsSend out
